@startuml DungeonEscape_StateFlow

[*] --> MENU : Application Start

MENU --> PLAYING : New Game
MENU --> SETTINGS : Settings
MENU --> [*] : Exit

SETTINGS --> MENU : Back

PLAYING --> PAUSED : ESC pressed
PLAYING --> GAME_OVER : Time expired\nOR Health = 0
PLAYING --> VICTORY : All levels\ncompleted
PLAYING --> PLAYING : Level completed\n(Next level)

PAUSED --> PLAYING : Resume
PAUSED --> MENU : Main Menu

GAME_OVER --> MENU : Main Menu
GAME_OVER --> PLAYING : Try Again

VICTORY --> MENU : Main Menu
VICTORY --> PLAYING : Play Again

note right of PLAYING
  Core gameplay state
  - Player movement
  - Enemy AI
  - Collision detection
  - Timer countdown
end note

note right of PAUSED
  Game frozen
  Timer paused
  Can resume or quit
end note

@enduml
